---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Capabilities">
  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900">
    <div class="max-w-5xl">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-12 leading-[0.9]">Manufacturing Capabilities</h1>
      
      <p class="text-xl md:text-3xl text-neutral-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">
        At Rupam Precision Engineering, our Precision Machining services are the hallmark of our expertise. We pride ourselves on delivering precision components that meet the highest industry standards, no matter the complexity of the material.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-neutral-900">
    <!-- Precision Machining & Materials -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0 border-b border-neutral-900">
      <div class="p-8 md:p-16 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-neutral-900">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8">Precision Machining Materials</h2>
        <div class="space-y-8 text-neutral-400 font-light">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">1. Ferrous Alloys</h3>
            <p>Rupam Precision Engineering excels in machining ferrous alloys such as stainless steel, carbon steel, and tool steel. Our precision machining processes guarantee that components crafted from ferrous alloys meet stringent quality and precision requirements.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">2. Non-Ferrous Alloys</h3>
            <p>From aluminum to brass and copper, we have the capabilities to machine a variety of non-ferrous alloys. Whether your project involves aerospace components or electrical parts, our precision machining delivers exceptional results.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">3. Exotic & Super Alloys</h3>
            <p>We stand as a pioneer in machining exotic alloys like Inconel, Hastelloy, titanium, Monel, Waspaloy, and Rene. Our specialized knowledge and advanced technology enable us to machine these demanding materials with precision.</p>
            <a href="/Rupam-Landing/capabilities/exotic-alloy-machining/" class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-neutral-600 hover:text-white hover:border-white transition-colors pb-1">Explore Exotic Alloys</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">4. Engineering Plastics</h3>
            <p>We specialize in engineering plastics such as Delrin, Teflon, and Vespel, chosen for their exceptional mechanical properties and resistance to wear and chemicals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 md:p-16 bg-neutral-950 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8">Core Processes</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-6 text-xl md:text-2xl font-light text-neutral-300">
          <li><a href="/Rupam-Landing/capabilities/cnc-machining/" class="flex items-center justify-between group hover:text-white transition-colors"><span class="uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-bold w-12 text-neutral-600 group-hover:text-neutral-400">01</span> <span class="flex-grow">CNC Machining</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/Rupam-Landing/capabilities/vmc-machining/" class="flex items-center justify-between group hover:text-white transition-colors"><span class="uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-bold w-12 text-neutral-600 group-hover:text-neutral-400">02</span> <span class="flex-grow">VMC Machining</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/Rupam-Landing/capabilities/4th-axis-machining/" class="flex items-center justify-between group hover:text-white transition-colors"><span class="uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-bold w-12 text-neutral-600 group-hover:text-neutral-400">03</span> <span class="flex-grow">Fourth-Axis Machining</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pressure Die Casting -->
    <div class="p-8 md:p-16 border-b border-neutral-900 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center hover:bg-neutral-950 transition-colors">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Pressure Die Casting (PDC)</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light text-lg mb-6">Our Pressure Die Casting (PDC) services are a testament to our dedication to precision and innovation. We have successfully sourced and manufactured components weighing up to 5 kilograms for a diverse clientele.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-neutral-400 font-light">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Aluminum Alloys</h4>
          <p>From lightweight ADC12 to high-strength A380 and A383, we cast aluminum components with precision.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Zinc Alloys</h4>
          <p>We excel in casting zinc components, including ZA-8, ZA-12, and ZA-27, chosen for durability and corrosion resistance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Investment Casting -->
    <div class="p-8 md:p-16 border-b border-neutral-900 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center hover:bg-neutral-950 transition-colors">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Investment Casting</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light text-lg mb-6">Our expertise extends beyond the realm of steel to encompass a broad range of materials, ensuring that your components are crafted from the most suitable substance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-neutral-400 font-light">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Steel & Super Alloys</h4>
          <p>From carbon and stainless steel to specialized super alloys like Inconel and Hastelloy for high-temperature environments.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Non-Ferrous & Specialized</h4>
          <p>Aluminum and copper-based materials, as well as high-nickel and cobalt-based alloys for unique applications.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sheet Metal -->
    <div class="p-8 md:p-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8 bg-neutral-900">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-2">Sheet Metal & Structural Fabrication</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light">For extensive fabrication projects, visit our parent company.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="https://www.rupamfab.com/" target="_blank" class="bg-white text-black px-8 py-4 uppercase text-sm font-bold hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap">Visit Rupam Fab</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
